    "detailed_description": "<strong>    WITH EACH PASSING MOMENT, THEIR DIMENSION GROWS... </strong><br><br><strong><i>FREAKHUNTER</i> is a dungeon-crawler-rail-shooter-action-hybrid</strong> for sickos, developed on vibes, and created as an exercise in actually finishing a video game. It's inspired by early FPS games like <i>SILENT DEBUGGERS</i> on PC-Engine and <i>Shadow Over Innsmouth</i> on Virtual Boy. <br><br>It'll probably take a little under two hours to reach the end.<br><br><strong>True HUNTERS wield a controller</strong> - although mouse and keyboard are supported!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES!</strong></h2>     <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Navigate 24 grid-based levels with smooth, slick movement! <br>     </li><li>Obliterate nasty FREAKS with 4 different juicy weapons! <br>     </li><li>Find special items to outsmart the FREAKS and shake up encounters!<br>     </li><li>Travel across 4 distinct worlds!<br>     </li><li>Experience a slightly blurry upscale of a 640x480 image with unfiltered textures! </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773870/extras/24c69b12b40a8d33ae27217d0db74e23.avif?t=1706287115\" width=397 height=355 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > WHAT PEOPLE ARE SAYING:</h2>    <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>&quot;intimidating&quot;<br>    </li><li>&quot;i've straight up never been motion sick from anything before&quot;<br>    </li><li>&quot;its' REALY COOL,&quot;<br>    </li><li>&quot;actually it's cubivore kileak: the blood&quot;<br>    </li><li>&quot;confusing&quot;<br>    </li><li>&quot;why does this feel like you put a voodoo card into a pc98&quot;<br>    </li><li>&quot;really devious&quot;<br>    </li><li>&quot;doesn't even let you get gay married 0/10&quot;</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773870/extras/fa5acbb6120ee5253a811da412940e61.avif?t=1706287115\" width=460 height=444 /></span>",
